# Input

```md
[link](destination "title")
[link](destination 'title')
[link](destination (title))

[double](destination "\"")
[single](destination '\'')
[double-and-single](destination "\" \"")
[single-and-double](destination "' ' \"")
[both-quotes](destination "\" '")
[parenthesis](destination (\)))
[mixed](destination (Shakespeare's "Romeo and Juliet" is a famous play))

[backslash](destination "\\\'")

![image](destination "title")

[reference]: destination "title"

[empty-double](destination "")

```


# Options

```json
{
  "markdown": {
    "formatter": {
      "quoteStyle": "single"
    }
  }
}
```

# Formatted

```md
[link](destination 'title')
[link](destination 'title')
[link](destination 'title')

[double](destination '"')
[single](destination "'")
[double-and-single](destination '" "')
[single-and-double](destination (' ' "))
[both-quotes](destination (" '))
[parenthesis](destination ')')
[mixed](destination (Shakespeare's "Romeo and Juliet" is a famous play))

[backslash](destination "\\'")

![image](destination 'title')

[reference]: destination 'title'

[empty-double](destination)

```
